    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It feels like a closing chapter. I look at my hands and I see someone who has done it all, but I also see someone who is just going to get older and slower, and more tired. There's a certain... beauty in leaving while the music is still perfect, don't you think? To stop before the decay starts?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
